1526
01:42:49,580 --> 01:42:50,497
Good.

1527
01:42:52,499 --> 01:42:53,458
That is good.

1528
01:42:55,961 --> 01:42:59,256
But I also made explicit
that we are unwilling

1529
01:42:59,298 --> 01:43:02,551
