with the sword.

1530
01:43:03,010 --> 01:43:04,511
Hear me.
We must hide you, Mother.

1531
01:43:04,553 --> 01:43:07,806
William, sit down.
Do not be rash. Rest, please.

1532
01:43:07,848 --> 01:43:09,725
