1614
01:50:18,737 --> 01:50:21,156
pronounced disapproval
of jailing persons

1615
01:50:21,197 --> 01:50:23,116
for their pious beliefs.

1616
01:50:23,617 --> 01:50:26,661
And due to lack
of treasonable evidence,

1617
01:50:26,703 --> 01:50:28,872
he believed the woman
should be freed.

