1626
01:51:03,239 --> 01:51:04,407
Mother is here now.

1627
01:51:05,659 --> 01:51:08,244
He's taken no food
for the last day.

1628
01:51:08,286 --> 01:51:11,873
We came as fast as we were able.
Rest, brother.

1629
01:51:11,915 --> 01:51:13,750
