here at Niskayuna.

1809
02:03:57,471 --> 02:03:59,390
Oh, thanks be to God.

1810
02:03:59,723 --> 02:04:01,517
All tyrannical
and oppressive governments

1811
02:04:01,559 --> 02:04:03,894
